{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 162,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9678344726562,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "The systematic review focused on the use of IGRAs to diagnose active pulmonary TB, given",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9313354492188,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "that data for extrapulmonary TB were lacking; nevertheless, the GDG consensus was that",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        524.4036254882812,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "recommendations for pulmonary TB could reasonably be extrapolated to extrapulmonary TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9036865234375,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "Industry involvement was unknown in 18% of studies and acknowledged in 27% of studies,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976725578308105,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.9641723632812,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "including donation of IGRA kits as well as work or financial relationships between authors",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        146.66119384765625,
        208.3490753173828,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "and IGRA manufacturers.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        175.0075225830078,
        373.04058837890625,
        191.3875274658203
      ],
      "text": "Strengths and limitations of the evidence base",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        200.138427734375,
        275.3533020019531,
        213.28343200683594
      ],
      "text": "Strengths and limitations were as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.890380859375,
        78.81909942626953,
        233.03538513183594
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        219.890380859375,
        526.9631958007812,
        233.03538513183594
      ],
      "text": "Heterogeneity was substantial for the primary outcomes of sensitivity and specificity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        235.390380859375,
        526.9651489257812,
        248.53538513183594
      ],
      "text": "Activities performed to minimize heterogeneity were empirical random-effects weighting,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        250.890380859375,
        526.6067504882812,
        264.035400390625
      ],
      "text": "excluding studies contributing fewer than 10 eligible individuals, and separately synthesizing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.947826385498047,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        266.390380859375,
        277.30584716796875,
        279.535400390625
      ],
      "text": "data for currently manufactured IGRAs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.890380859375,
        78.81909942626953,
        295.035400390625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        281.890380859375,
        526.9853515625,
        295.035400390625
      ],
      "text": "No standard criteria exist for defining high TB incidence countries, and the World Bank",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        297.390380859375,
        527.0637817382812,
        310.535400390625
      ],
      "text": "income classification is an imperfect surrogate for national TB incidence; nevertheless, results",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951844215393066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        312.890380859375,
        526.7433471679688,
        326.035400390625
      ],
      "text": "were fundamentally unchanged when restricted to countries with an arbitrarily chosen",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        328.3904113769531,
        370.61700439453125,
        341.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "annual TB incidence of at least 50 per 100 000 population.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.8904113769531,
        78.81909942626953,
        357.0354309082031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        343.8904113769531,
        526.7224731445312,
        357.0354309082031
      ],
      "text": "It is possible that ongoing studies were missed, despite systematic searching. It is also",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        359.3904113769531,
        526.9644165039062,
        372.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "possible that studies that found poor IGRA performance were less likely to be published.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        374.8904113769531,
        524.0823364257812,
        388.0354309082031
      ],
      "text": "Given the lack of statistical methods to account for publication bias in diagnostic meta-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        390.3904113769531,
        527.0082397460938,
        403.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "analyses, it would be prudent to assume some degree of overestimation of estimates due",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        405.8904113769531,
        178.5157928466797,
        419.0354309082031
      ],
      "text": "to publication bias.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.3904113769531,
        78.81909942626953,
        434.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        421.3904113769531,
        526.9641723632812,
        434.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "The systematic review focused on test accuracy (i.e. sensitivity and specificity) and indirect",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        436.8904113769531,
        526.93115234375,
        450.0354309082031
      ],
      "text": "assessment of patient impact (false positive and false negative results). None of the studies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        452.3904113769531,
        527.1602783203125,
        465.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "reviewed provided information on patient-important outcomes (i.e. showing that IGRAs used",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        467.8904113769531,
        526.7037353515625,
        481.0354309082031
      ],
      "text": "in a given situation resulted in a clinically relevant improvement in patient care or outcomes).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.954856872558594,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        483.3904113769531,
        493.4631652832031,
        496.5354309082031
      ],
      "text": "In addition, no information was available on the values and preferences of patients.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.22900390625,
        526.8634033203125,
        523.3740234375
      ],
      "text": "Data synthesis was structured around the preset PICO question, as outlined above. Web Annex",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977025985717773,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.72900390625,
        405.1512145996094,
        538.8740234375
      ],
      "text": "I provides additional information on evidence synthesis and analysis.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.2405395507812,
        330.5142517089844,
        567.6205444335938
      ],
      "text": "Operational aspects of the use of IGRAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.3715209960938,
        345.5763244628906,
        589.5165405273438
      ],
      "text": "Operational aspects of the use of IGRAs were as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.12353515625,
        78.81909942626953,
        609.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        596.12353515625,
        526.776123046875,
        609.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "Cost of IGRAs was mentioned by four studies, which all stated that the assays are too",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        611.62353515625,
        326.7926940917969,
        624.7685546875
      ],
      "text": "expensive and that this is a limitation to their use.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.12353515625,
        78.81909942626953,
        640.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        627.12353515625,
        526.9642944335938,
        640.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "Only one study addressed reproducibility of T-Spot by assessing inter-observer agreement;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        642.62353515625,
        524.4109497070312,
        655.7685546875
      ],
      "text": "it showed excellent correlation. No other study mentioned the issue of test reproducibility.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.12353515625,
        78.81909942626953,
        671.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        658.12353515625,
        526.9654541015625,
        671.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "Twelve studies reported on accepted transport times of samples to the laboratory, which",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        673.62353515625,
        527.2653198242188,
        686.7685546875
      ],
      "text": "were mainly less than 6 hours (i.e. within the limit accepted by the test manufacturers). One",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989544868469238,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        689.12353515625,
        526.96435546875,
        702.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "study accepted a transport time of 16 hours and another 24 hours. None reported on the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        704.62353515625,
        527.2387084960938,
        717.7685546875
      ],
      "text": "impact of the transport times (i.e. delay between drawing the blood and initiating the IGRA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989745140075684,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        720.12353515625,
        292.6619873046875,
        733.2685546875
      ],
      "text": "test) and IGRA test results or performance.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        735.62353515625,
        78.81909942626953,
        748.7685546875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        735.62353515625,
        311.1407470703125,
        748.7685546875
      ],
      "text": "No study reported on time-to-result for IGRAs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "146 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}